# P6: the controls that work without a stream loaded.
#
# Most of the transport is disabled until a file is chosen -- -5s, Play, +5s,
# Seek and Show resolution are all greyed in the launch state -- and choosing a
# file opens a modal panel this file cannot drive to a selection, only cancel.
# What is left is genuinely testable: two toggles whose state the status line
# reports, and two steppers whose value is on screen.
#
# The Resolution popup is left alone for the same reason as P19's menu: it opens
# a window of its own that cannot be measured while AppKit hit testing is broken.
#
# P6：在尚未載入串流時仍可操作的控制項。
#
# 大部分播放控制在選擇檔案前都是停用的——-5s、Play、+5s、Seek 與 Show resolution 在啟動狀態下全為
# 灰色——而選擇檔案會開啟一個 modal 面板，本檔無法把它驅動到「選定」，只能取消。剩下的部分是確實
# 可測的：兩個切換開關（其狀態會由狀態列回報），以及兩個數值就顯示在畫面上的 stepper。
#
# Resolution 下拉選單不予碰觸，理由與 P19 的選單相同：它會開啟一個獨立視窗，而在 AppKit hit
# testing 損壞期間無法量測。
#
# origin=frame. Window 1074x825 points, capture 2152x1650 -- scale 2, so these are
# the image coordinates halved.
# origin=frame。視窗 1074x825 點，擷取 2152x1650——scale 2，因此下列為影像座標的一半。
# **Rewritten 2026-09-28 from p6-macos-final-20260928-090607.png (1120 x 828).** The
# transport row is at y 741 and the rows clicked 752-760, below it; Speed and FPS are
# pop-up menus ("1x", "30" with the up-down glyph), not steppers, so "stepper up" and
# "stepper down" clicks meant nothing even where they landed; and every control was
# operated twice, so a working run ended on the launch state. Each control is now
# operated once, and the two pop-ups are driven by keyboard as P19 drives a menu.
# **2026-09-28 依 p6-macos-final-20260928-090607.png(1120 x 828)改寫。**傳輸列在 y 741,那些列點的是 752-760,
# 在它下面;Speed 與 FPS 是彈出選單,不是步進器,所以「上/下」的點擊即使命中也沒有意義;而且每個控制項都操作兩次,
# 正常的一次會停在啟動狀態。現在每個控制項只操作一次,兩個彈出選單比照 P19 用鍵盤操作。
click,803,750,frame,left,,,"Sound -- y 750: the transport row sat at 741 on one run and 755 on the next (p6-macos-final-20260928-102712.png), and every row at 741 missed on the second; 750 is inside the buttons in both. It starts on; the button must lose its highlight and the status line must say Sound off",macos
sleep,,,,,,800000,,macos
